tests[1]{command,scope,timeout_seconds,provenance{author,created_at,source_kind,source_ref}}:
  node scripts/run-tests.mjs test -- tests/integration/cli/health-projection-precedence.integration.spec.ts tests/unit/sdk/health-check-only-contract.spec.ts tests/unit/scripts/flag-lexicon-gate.spec.ts,project,300,"harness:claude-code","2026-11-05T22:21:11.630Z",local_mutation,fix/health-projection-precedence
close_reason: "Fixed: pm health --full --summary now runs every check and returns the summary projection instead of silently dropping --summary. --full stays a check-scope flag, and an explicit --summary, otherwise an explicit --brief, selects the projection. --strict-exit implies the summary only without --full. The CLI, PmClient.health and MCP action dispatch agree."
